# Desert Were-Worm: "for the first time each turn" is about attacking with total power 12 or greater, not about attacking.
# Turn 9 (Bot1 has five Mountains: the Worm is a 10/5): Aurelia, the Warleader attacks alone first - total power 3, no Worm
# trigger - and her own trigger (first attack of the turn) untaps everything and gives an additional combat phase. In that
# one Bot1 attacks with the Worm and Aurelia: total power 13, the first time this turn that reaches 12, so the Worm's trigger
# untaps the attackers and gives a third combat phase. There they attack once more, 13 again but no longer the first time (the
# declaration before it was 13), so no fourth combat. Bot2 starts at 60 life: 3 + 13 + 13 = 29 damage.

